  "name": "Shrimp and Mushroom Linguini",
  "subtitle": "Linguini with creamy herb sauce, mushrooms, and shrimp",
  "description": "Tender linguini is served with sautéed mushrooms, cooked shrimp, and a creamy garlic-herb sauce.",
